From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Electron Agent Runtime <agent-runtime@electron.local>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:20:00 +0000
Subject: [electron] limit renderer fonts to the core family set

When electron-agent-font-policy=core is present, named families outside
Arial, Courier New, Georgia, Times New Roman, Trebuchet MS, and Verdana do
not match. Generic families still use the platform mapping. local() matches
only those published names. queryLocalFonts drops other families.
System-wide glyph search is replaced by the last-resort font. Nothing here
is compiled in this change.

